{"symbol":"OCTAVIUSPL","yahoo":"OCTAVIUSPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Octavius Plantations Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","website":"https://octaviusplantations.com","about":"Octavius Plantations Limited engages in processing and trading agricultural produce in India. The company is involved in coffee cultivating, harvesting, roasting, and storing; tea production; cultivation of spices, fruits, and medicinal and aromatic plants, such as ondelaga, coleus, ashwagandha, sarpagandha, amla, stevia, shatavari, tulsi, aloe vera, patchouli, coleus, and lemon grass; and trading of commodities, including pepper, maize, rice, and other agro products. It also offers green coffee beans, roasted coffee beans, filter coffee, and instant coffee. The company sells its products under the Octavius brand. Octavius Plantations Limited was founded in 1898 and is based in New Delhi, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:45:27+00:00","quote":{"price":43.68,"prevClose":43.68,"marketCap":13.1,"high52":57.59,"low52":36.5,"pe":19.59,"bookValue":66.17,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":0.3,"insiders":79.4,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-07-06","2021-07-07","2021-07-08","2021-07-09","2021-07-12","2021-07-13","2021-07-14","2021-07-15","2021-07-16","2021-07-19","2021-07-20","2021-07-22","2021-07-23","2021-07-26","2021-07-27","2021-07-28","2021-07-29","2021-07-30","2021-08-02","2021-08-03","2021-08-04","2021-08-05","2021-08-06","2021-08-09","2021-08-10","2021-08-11","2021-08-12","2021-08-13","2021-08-16","2021-08-17","2021-08-18","2021-08-20","2021-08-23","2021-08-24","2021-08-25","2021-08-26","2021-08-27","2021-08-30","2021-08-31","2021-09-01","2021-09-02","2021-09-03","2021-09-06","2021-09-07","2021-09-08","2021-09-09","2021-09-13","2021-09-14","2021-09-15","2021-09-16","2021-09-17","2021-09-20","2021-09-21","2021-09-22","2021-09-23","2021-09-24","2021-09-27","2021-09-28","2021-09-29","2021-09-30","2021-10-01","2021-10-04","2021-10-05","2021-